# Native build outputs — regenerated by build.sh. Never commit the .so payload:
# it was 76% of the tracked tree and ~95% of the whole repo, so it was purged
# from history (and build.sh recreates every file here).
app/src/main/jniLibs/

# Real-game test fixtures — deliberately NOT distributed in git (copyright /
# redistribution). Keep your own copies here; the tests that need them print
# `SKIP …` and pass without, so a fresh clone and CI still build.
crates/*/testdata/*
!crates/*/testdata/README.md

logcat.txt
releases/
issuesfile/
*.hprof

# Local-only working notes — deliberately NOT distributed. TODO.md is a running
# changelog/roadmap plus internal archaeology (candidate lists tried, fixture
# post-mortems, tag/PR cleanup notes); it is read from disk, never from a clone.
# Kept out of history as well, so a broad `git add` cannot sweep it back in.
TODO.md

# Local tooling state — machine-specific, or regenerated by the build.
# `.kotlin/` and `.claude/` only *looked* ignored: the former survived because its
# contents happened to match `*.log` / `.DS_Store`, and the latter was covered by
# a machine-global exclude (`~/.config/git/ignore`), not by this repo. One new
# non-log file in either directory would have walked straight into a commit.
.claude/
.kotlin/
.workbuddy-ai/

# AGP's CMake/NDK scratch tree — the sibling of `.externalNativeBuild/` above.
.cxx/
